   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = - 2 x^{2} + 5 x \\) and \\( g(x) = - x \\). Let R be the region bounded by the graphs of f and g. R is the base of a solid whose cross sections perpendicular to the x-axis are equilateral triangles. Find the exact volume of the solid.",
      "command_verb": "find"
   },
